  "final_answer": "I have all the information I need from the Lionel Messi player page on ESPN. Let me record the findings:\n\n**Messi's Last 5 Games (all with Inter Miami CF - MIA):**\n\n1. **Mon 9/21** - vs **San Diego FC (SD)** - MLS - **Drew 2-2**\n2. **Thu 9/17** - vs **Cruz Azul (CAZ)** - Campeones Cup - **Won 2-0**\n3. **Sun 9/13** - vs **Nashville SC (NSH)** - MLS - **Drew 2-2**\n4. **Thu 9/10** - @ **Chicago Fire FC (CHI)** - MLS - **Drew 1-1**\n5. **Sun 9/6** - vs **Atlanta United FC (ATL)** - MLS - **Drew 2-2**\n\nI have successfully completed the task. Here are the results:\n\n## Lionel Messi's Last 5 Games (per ESPN)\n\n**Team currently playing for:** Inter Miami CF (MIA) - wearing #10 as a Forward.\n\n| Date | Opponent | Competition | Result |\n|------|----------|-------------|--------|\n| Mon 9/21 | vs San Diego FC | MLS | **D 2-2** |\n| Thu 9/17 | vs Cruz Azul | Campeones Cup | **W 2-0** |\n| Sun 9/13 | vs Nashville SC | MLS | **D 2-2** |\n| Thu 9/10 | @ Chicago Fire FC | MLS | **D 1-1** |\n| Sun 9/6 | vs Atlanta United FC | MLS | **D 2-2** |\n\n**Summary:**\n- In all 5 of his recent games, Messi played for **Inter Miami CF**.\n- Results: **1 Win** (vs Cruz Azul in Campeones Cup), and **4 Draws** in MLS matches (San Diego FC, Nashville SC, Chicago Fire FC, and Atlanta United FC).\n- Messi's personal stats across these 5 games: 2 goals, 2 assists, 35 total shots, 15 shots on goal.\n\nNote: The ESPN profile only lists Messi's recent games with his current team (Inter Miami CF). It does not display a historical list of all clubs he has played for in that view. However, his current club as shown on ESPN is Inter Miami CF. (For broader career history, Messi's clubs have famously included Newell's Old Boys, FC Barcelona, Paris Saint-Germain, and Inter Miami CF, but that information isn't shown in the current ESPN profile page.)",
